        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Zenzenzense\", \"Your Name\"\n- People: Makoto Shinkai\n- Companies: Radwimps, CoMix Wave Films\n- Topics: film soundtracks, theme songs\n\nFacts:\n- \"Your Name\" (Japanese: 君の名は。, Hepburn: Kimi no Na wa.) is a 2016 Japanese animated drama film.\n- Makoto Shinkai wrote and directed \"Your Name\".\n- CoMix Wave Films produced \"Your Name\".\n- \"Zenzenzense\" (Japanese: 前前前世, \"Past Past Past Life\") is a song by the Japanese rock band Radwimps.\n- \"Zenzenzense\" was one of four theme songs used in the film \"Your Name\".\n- Radwimps composed 26 songs for the soundtrack of \"Your Name\", including \"Zenzenzense\".",
